  "description": "Camp Furst State is an annual furry camping trip run by Reaux and Jess Hillard of The Furst State. Campers spend several days at Cape Henlopen State Park in Sussex County, Delaware. It was first held in June 2009 and moved to September from 2011, when campers began choosing between Camper and Outdoorsman registration levels, with badges and t-shirts designed by Jess Hillard. Five editions were held, from 2009 to 2013.",
